# SEDS SL – [Chapter Name]

## About the Chapter



SEDS SL [Chapter Name] is a recognized chapter under SEDS Sri Lanka, dedicated to promoting space science, astronomy, aerospace engineering, and STEM innovation among students.



The chapter operates within [University/Institution Name] and contributes to the national SEDS SL mission of advancing space exploration awareness and research culture in Sri Lanka.



### Mission

> To inspire and empower students through space-related education, research, and innovation initiatives.



### Vision

> To build a sustainable student-led ecosystem that contributes to Sri Lanka’s growing space and technology sector.



### Organizational Structure
- Chapter Lead
- Vice Lead
- Secretary
- Treasurer
- Technical Team
- Research & Development Team
- Media & Outreach Team
- Event Coordination Team



### Focus Areas
- Space Science and Astronomy
- Rocketry and Propulsion
- Satellite Development
- Robotics and Embedded Systems
- Artificial Intelligence and Data Science for Space Applications
- STEM Outreach Programs



### Key Activities
- Workshops and technical sessions
- Research projects
- National and international competitions
- School outreach programs
- Industry collaborations
- Space awareness campaigns
